<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs end mostly weaker in NY, Dow sheds 36 pts.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs end mostly weaker in NY, Dow sheds 36 pts.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs ended mostly weaker in New York, as the Dow Jones Industrial fell 36.15 points to 5,930.62.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S., Britain and Australia.</p>
<p>Company   Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>Tranz Rail   N.Y.    US$14	     -0 1/2</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$24 3/8	 -0 1/8</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$24 7/8	 +0 1/4</p>
<p>FCL Paper	 N.Y.    US$19 3/8	 -0 3/8</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$15	     -0 3/8</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$76 7/8	 -2 1/8</p>
<p>Guinness Peat  London  34 1/2	    -0 1/2</p>
<p>Brierley	 London  64		    nil</p>
<p>NZ IT	    London  236 1/2	     -1</p>
<p>Foreign &amp; Col London  157 1/2	   +0 1/2</p>
<p>Templeton	London  137 1/2	     -1</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  A$3.07		nil</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$1.38		nil</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$3.09		nil</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of 16 shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
